Added a choice of the block types that Markdown and HTML become, such as code blocks or tables as text: a `blocks` table in a profile sets them for a site, and `--blocks` on `create-page` and `upload-tree`, the `blocks` argument of the MCP tools `create_page` and `upload_tree`, or `blocks_setting` in Python changes them for one call. An unknown block type or option is refused before any request is sent. The `markdown` extra now needs `collective.html2blocks` 1.0.0b1 or later. @ericof
